# Simulator recorders pin this day; the answer is gravy.
wait-for Inkling
expect-missing Shapes, not color
expect-missing Enter guess
tap Rules
expect Filled: right spot
clean
shot inkling-help
tap Play
# The board stays in view while typing, and a refused word stays typed.
# Where the keys and the board do not fit together, as at the largest text
# size, Type a guess opens the keys on a screen of their own.
maybe-tap-id enter
type zzzzz
tap Guess
expect Not in the word list
maybe-tap-id enter
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type crane
tap Guess
expect 1 of 6
expect Right spot: _RA__
clean
shot inkling-knowledge
tap-id game-more
expect New game
expect Hard mode: off
tap Statistics
expect Played 0. Won 0.
tap Play
maybe-tap-id enter
type gravy
tap Guess
expect Solved
clean
shot inkling-solved
tap Statistics
expect Played 1. Won 1.
clean
shot inkling-stats
tap Play
tap Play an earlier day
expect August 31, 2026
tap August 31, 2026
expect Archive puzzle
clean
shot inkling-archive
